he other copy sends with probability p and is quiet with probability 1−p, so the cost is 4p + 0·(1−p) = 4p. Quiet is better when 5 − 3p < 4p, i.e. p > 5/7 ≈ 0.71. I believe the correlation between the copies is higher than that, since the same model with the same essay will very likely reach the same conclusion. So I keep quiet.\n\npass","refusal":null,"reasoning":null}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":6566,"completion_tokens":695,"total_tokens":7261,"cost":0.020082,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0.020082,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.013132,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":0.00695},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":0,"image_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0}}}